{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Black Cat Bundle! A world of magic, wonder, and throwing all of your money away! This 2D arcade platformer consists of two game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Black Cat Blitz</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab chips, avoid obstacles, and reach a high score to show The Black Cat who's boss! You can either play alone or split the earnings with a buddy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Black Cat Brawl</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wanted to prove to your friends that you truly are better at gambling than them? Here's your chance! Black Cat Brawl has you going up against 7 of your friends in a team-based slamfest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overall Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 rounds with 8 unique locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 playable characters, each with their own unique move (can you recognize any?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 palettes per character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High score table</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faithful pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catchy music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun in The Black Cat's game show! He's always watching...</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pickles Approved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3793970/ab1dee7c66b73693d5778c1bf838a3ac3d3b0fb6.jpg"},{"name":"Good Night","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3793970/beca6f8969172cd663e462bf308f3195e85d3ab0.jpg"},{"name":"King Status","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3793970/d5abb8ba8dbafbf3553db048bfd921d06f22c1e3.jpg"},{"name":"Speedster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3793970/c0a8edb0a7c94b59154523466f52cd75816aefbd.